1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:03,067
[GROANS] She slapped me
really hard...

2
00:00:05,733 --> 00:00:12,733
[PLAYFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

3
00:00:17,033 --> 00:00:21,233
[SENSUAL MUSIC PLAYING]

4
00:00:21,233 --> 00:00:23,467
[HANNAH] He smells so good!

5
00:00:23,467 --> 00:00:25,967
<i> Like freshly brewed coffee!</i>

6
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:32,633
[GIGGLING]

7
00:00:32,633 --> 00:00:34,067
[MUSIC STOPS]

8
00:00:34,567 --> 00:00:36,267
I'll go get more ice.

9
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:39,433
(In Korean) Thank you!

10
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:43,667
[GIGGLING]

11
00:00:43,667 --> 00:00:47,167
[BRIGHT MUSIC PLAYING]

12
00:00:47,167 --> 00:00:48,633
- [SLAPS]
- Ouch!

13
00:00:50,033 --> 00:00:51,733
Hannah,
that's not why you're here!

14
00:00:51,733 --> 00:00:53,500
Stop messing around!

15
00:00:53,500 --> 00:00:59,667
[PLAYFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

16
00:00:59,667 --> 00:01:02,200
Where are the pockets
in this thing?!

17
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:03,667
[JACKET FLAPPING]

18
00:01:05,233 --> 00:01:07,200
You think I'm stupid?

19
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:14,167
[PLAYFUL MUSIC CONTINUES]

20
00:01:14,200 --> 00:01:16,833
Sir, please,
you don't understand!

21
00:01:16,833 --> 00:01:18,500
I need that!

22
00:01:18,500 --> 00:01:20,333
That's very important!

23
00:01:20,333 --> 00:01:21,733
My mother...

24
00:01:21,733 --> 00:01:24,167
operation money...
please, sir?

25
00:01:24,733 --> 00:01:26,433
Tell me how you got this.

26
00:01:27,600 --> 00:01:29,233
Why?

27
00:01:29,233 --> 00:01:31,100
It's confidential.

28
00:01:31,100 --> 00:01:32,600
Well, I won't tell you then.

29
00:01:34,333 --> 00:01:36,067
Then say goodbye
to your necklace.

30
00:01:37,467 --> 00:01:40,433
Hey, just because you're tall
doesn't mean I won't fight back!

31
00:01:41,300 --> 00:01:43,600
- [GRUNTS]
- Come and get it!

32
00:01:43,600 --> 00:01:50,600
[ROMANTIC MUSIC PLAYING]

33
00:02:07,100 --> 00:02:08,667
Babe!

34
00:02:09,200 --> 00:02:11,133
I'm home!

35
00:02:11,133 --> 00:02:16,467
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

36
00:02:16,500 --> 00:02:17,867
[GASPS]

37
00:02:18,667 --> 00:02:20,533
Who the hell is this girl?!

38
00:02:20,533 --> 00:02:27,533
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC CONTINUES]
